{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人因为不愿再一次次受委屈而离开熟悉的生活，却始终怀念曾被接纳、有人陪伴的温暖，因此反复动摇，不知道是否应该回去。最后，他承认过去的美好和受过的伤都是真的，决定不再为了留住亲近而委屈自己，先好好过眼下的生活，也继续期待未来的亲密关系。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"离开后失落无依\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"不愿受气也不舍美好\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"想起被接纳而短暂欢喜\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"怀念让他怀疑离开\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"舍不得美好却已疲惫\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"想念有人相伴的日子\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"孤单使他怀疑离开\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"回忆只能短暂取暖\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"分不清为何想回去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"想念归属却不敢回头\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"先稳住眼下再谈回头\",\n      \"echo\": \"S10\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"伤痛与美好都是真的\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"期待亲近也能独自生活\",\n      \"echo\": \"S12\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是S03，停留时间较短，散开的词又很多，愤怒、怀念、亲近、心酸等情绪交织在一起，不容易一次抓全；S09的困惑也比较难彻底理解。最抓人的是S06到S07从温暖回忆突然转向孤独和不安的反差，以及S12到S13逐渐放下内心冲突、重新获得向前生活的力量。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2e89f42d-45f7-4873-a72c-62040450f8b0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T194703674956Z", "elapsed_seconds": 87.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:48:31.028894+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7e65b218a8bd6113b53408314cd730cff02c6000394fbee52b1ddefc65893079", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T194703674956Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1cfeda72630e370fd09b6479c9867123a42a463b0e436ef9c167d4c3d0b74f63"}}}
